# Domain Layer Qaydaları

## Entity Əsas Sinifi

Bütün entity-lər `BaseEntity`-dən irsi alır:

```csharp
// Domain/Common/BaseEntity.cs
public abstract class BaseEntity
{
    public Guid Id { get; protected set; } = Guid.NewGuid();
    public DateTime CreatedAt { get; protected set; } = DateTime.UtcNow;
    public DateTime? UpdatedAt { get; protected set; }

    protected void SetUpdated() => UpdatedAt = DateTime.UtcNow;
}
```

## Entity Strukturu

- Sahələr `private set` — xarici kod birbaşa dəyər təyin edə bilməz.
- Dəyişiklik üçün domain metodları (eg. `Confirm()`, `Cancel()`, `ApplyDiscount()`).
- Konstruktor validasiyası: null/boş dəyər qəbul etmə, `ArgumentException` at.

```csharp
// ✅ DÜZGÜN
public class Order : BaseEntity
{
    public Guid UserId { get; private set; }
    public OrderStatus Status { get; private set; }
    public decimal TotalAmount { get; private set; }
    private readonly List<OrderItem> _items = [];
    public IReadOnlyCollection<OrderItem> Items => _items.AsReadOnly();

    private Order() { } // EF Core üçün

    public static Order Create(Guid userId, decimal totalAmount)
    {
        ArgumentOutOfRangeException.ThrowIfNegativeOrZero(totalAmount);
        return new Order { UserId = userId, TotalAmount = totalAmount, Status = OrderStatus.Pending };
    }

    public void Confirm() 
    {
        if (Status != OrderStatus.Pending)
            throw new DomainException("Yalnız gözləmədə olan sifariş təsdiq edilə bilər.");
        Status = OrderStatus.Confirmed;
        SetUpdated();
    }
}

// ❌ YANLIŞ — public set, no protection
public class Order { public OrderStatus Status { get; set; } }
```

## Enum-lar

```csharp
// Domain/Enums/OrderStatus.cs
public enum OrderStatus
{
    Pending = 0,
    Confirmed = 1,
    Preparing = 2,
    Shipped = 3,
    Delivered = 4,
    Cancelled = 5,
    ReturnRequested = 6,
    Returned = 7
}

public enum DeliveryType { Standard, SameDay, Scheduled }
public enum PaymentMethod { Card, CashOnDelivery, BankTransfer }
public enum DiscountType { Percent, Fixed }
public enum UserRole { Customer, Admin, Seller }
```

## Value Object-lər

Dəyər obyektləri `record` ilə:

```csharp
// Domain/ValueObjects/Money.cs
public record Money(decimal Amount, string Currency = "AZN")
{
    public static Money Zero => new(0);
    public Money Add(Money other) => this with { Amount = Amount + other.Amount };
}

// Domain/ValueObjects/AddressSnapshot.cs — Order-da JSON saxlanılır
public record AddressSnapshot(
    string RecipientName, string RecipientPhone,
    string City, string District, string Line, string PostalCode);
```

## Domain Exception-ları

```csharp
// Domain/Exceptions/DomainException.cs
public class DomainException(string message) : Exception(message);

// Domain/Exceptions/NotFoundException.cs
public class NotFoundException(string entity, object key)
    : Exception($"{entity} (id: {key}) tapılmadı.");
```

## Qeydlər

- Domain layer-də EF Core, MediatR, FluentValidation, HTTP referansı olmayacaq.
- `Domain/Entities/`, `Domain/Enums/`, `Domain/ValueObjects/`, `Domain/Exceptions/` qovluq strukturunu qoru.
